        "link": "https://www.limesonline.com/rubriche/il-mondo-oggi/guerra-israele-usa-iran-turchia-cina-corea-del-nord-xi-jinping-kim-jong-un-fcas-gasdotto-nigeria-niger-algeria-22121430/",
